        "description": "将可视化结果输出为独立 HTML 文件、嵌入 Jupyter/Notebook、生成静态组件或内联资源。",
        "evidence": ["src/bokeh/io/output.py:50", "src/bokeh/embed/standalone.py", "src/bokeh/io/saving.py", "src/bokeh/io/showing.py"]
